      "zh-Hant": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "初次見面，用"
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T01.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t1"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "開場，介紹完自己後常接"
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T05.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t2"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "。"
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T06.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t1"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "則用來回應對方，帶有「我才要請你多關照」的意思。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "When meeting someone for the first time, open with "
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T01.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t1"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": ". After introducing yourself, you often add "
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T05.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t2"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": ". Use "
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T06.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t1"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": " in reply, with the sense of “Likewise, I look forward to getting to know you.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      "ja": {
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "初対面では「"
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T01.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t1"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "」であいさつし、自己紹介の後によく「"
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T05.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t2"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "」を添えます。「"
          },
          {
            "ref": {
              "sourceId": "L",
              "unit": "T06.s1",
              "from": "t1",
              "to": "t1"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "」は相手への返事で、自分も同じ気持ちであることを伝えます。"
          }
        ]
      }
